{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-04-18 16:15:00', 'title': "SWEP PRESENTED WITH TRANE TECHNOLOGIES' 2021 CONTINUOUS IMPROVEMENT AWARD", 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , APRIL 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SWEP, PART OF DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV), RECENTLY RECEIVED THE 2021 CONTINUOUS IMPROVEMENT AWARD FROM TRANE TECHNOLOGIES, A WORLD LEADER IN AIR CONDITIONING SYSTEMS, SERVICES AND SOLUTIONS.'}